[SIZE="4"][B]FAQ[/B][/SIZE]

[B]Does this wipe my data?[/B]
No. Nothing is erased, and fastboot oem unlock is not used.

[B]Does it work on the D620, D618 or other G2 Mini models?[/B]
No. Those use a Snapdragon 400 and a completely different bootloader. This is for the Tegra 4i [B]D625[/B] only.

[B]My firmware is not D62510c.[/B]
The script will refuse your bootloader. Do not try to force it.

[B]Is a one-click tool available?[/B]
No. This is a documented patch for users who can back up, verify and restore their own bootloader.

[SIZE="4"][B]Technical details[/B][/SIZE]

Offsets, the BCT integrity analysis and the hardware evidence are in the repository: [URL="https://github.com/chijure-android-system-development/lg-d625-tegra-bootloader-patch/blob/main/BOOTLOADER_PATCH_ANALYSIS.md"]BOOTLOADER_PATCH_ANALYSIS.md[/URL].

